# LF everywhere. rustfmt.toml pins newline_style = "Unix", and Windows git
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite every checkout to CRLF
# and fail `cargo fmt --check`. Forcing eol=lf keeps the tree byte-identical
# on Linux and Windows, which the determinism checks in vxe-world also rely on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never normalised or diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.vox  binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.wav  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff2 binary
